docs {
  GET /pre-consultation/session/patient_baseline/v2/
  
  Returns saved layer data including height (cm) and weight (kg) from CustomerProfile.
  Works even when session status is completed.
  Reference: docs/pre_consultation/api-pre-consultation-v2.md
}
